[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_ROYAL]
Finale of the Royals

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_ROYAL_desc]
§g“Generations come and generations go, but the dark remains forever.”§!\nNothing lasts forever. Even the longest, the most glittering reign must come to an end someday. The crystal royals can not escape their determined fate.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_ROYAL]
皇室的谢幕

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_ROYAL_desc]
§g“一代过去，一代又来，但黑暗永远存在。”§!\n没有什么能永恒。即使是最长久、最辉煌的统治，终究有一天也会结束。水晶帝国的皇室也注定无法逃脱这个命运。

